{
  "title": "THE ROOM THAT WASN'T THERE - Part 1: Don't Open the Door",
  "series": "THE ROOM THAT WASN'T THERE",
  "part": 1,
  "notes": "Second person, present tense. One line = one cut (plus inserts). Every voice uses the same TTS voice on purpose: the caller, the texts, the hallway voice and the thing all 'sound exactly like yours'. Text stays in normal case (TTS reads ALL-CAPS words as letters); captions are rendered ALL CAPS.",
  "voice_ref": null,
  "voices": {},
  "lead_in": 0.15,
  "tail": 0.3,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "R01",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "You wake up at three-seventeen AM.",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "R02",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Your phone is ringing.",
      "delivery": "slow",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "R03",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "It's an unknown number. You answer.",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "R04",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "A voice whispers.",
      "delivery": "whisper",
      "emotion": 0.4,
      "pause_after": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R05",
      "who": "caller",
      "text": "\"Whatever you do, don't open your bedroom door.\"",
      "delivery": "whisper",
      "emotion": 0.4,
      "pause_after": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "R06",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "You freeze. Because something is already knocking on it.",
      "delivery": "dramatic",
      "emotion": 0.55,
      "pause_after": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "R07",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Three slow knocks.",
      "delivery": "whisper",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "R08",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Then your phone vibrates again. A text message.",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "R09",
      "who": "texter",
      "text": "\"I'm outside. Let me in.\"",
      "delivery": "whisper",
      "emotion": 0.4,
      "pause_after": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "R10",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "You stare at the message. Then another one arrives.",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "R11",
      "who": "texter",
      "text": "\"Don't listen to the thing... pretending to be me.\"",
      "delivery": "slow",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "R12",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Your stomach drops.",
      "delivery": "dramatic",
      "emotion": 0.55,
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "R13",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Because the voice on the phone sounds exactly like yours.",
      "delivery": "dramatic",
      "emotion": 0.55,
      "pause_after": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "R14",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Suddenly, the knocking stops. Silence.",
      "delivery": "whisper",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "R15",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Then... you hear your own voice. From the hallway.",
      "delivery": "slow",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "R16",
      "who": "double",
      "text": "\"Hey. It's okay. I'm coming inside.\"",
      "delivery": "warm",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "R17",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "You look at your bedroom door. The handle slowly begins to turn.",
      "delivery": "slow",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "R18",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "But there's something strange.",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R19",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Your bedroom door has no lock.",
      "delivery": "dramatic",
      "emotion": 0.55,
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "R20",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "And you've never heard it creak... like that before.",
      "delivery": "slow",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "R21",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Your phone lights up one last time. A new message.",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "R22",
      "who": "texter",
      "text": "\"There's a second door behind your wardrobe. Get inside. Now.\"",
      "delivery": "excited",
      "emotion": 0.65,
      "pause_after": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "R23",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "You turn toward your wardrobe.",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R24",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "And for the first time, you notice it. A small wooden door, behind it.",
      "delivery": "slow",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "R25",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Something scratches from the other side.",
      "delivery": "whisper",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "R26",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Then a voice whispers.",
      "delivery": "whisper",
      "emotion": 0.45,
      "pause_after": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R27",
      "who": "thing",
      "text": "\"Finally. You found me.\"",
      "delivery": "whisper",
      "emotion": 0.4,
      "pause_after": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "R28",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "What do you do? Comment A or B.",
      "delivery": "dramatic",
      "emotion": 0.55,
      "pause_after": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "R29",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "Choose carefully. Because one of these doors leads to you.",
      "delivery": "slow",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "R30",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "The other leads to something wearing your face.",
      "delivery": "slow",
      "emotion": 0.55,
      "pause_after": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "R31",
      "who": "narrator",
      "text": "The top comment decides.",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "emotion": 0.5,
      "pause_after": 0.0
    }
  ]
}
